 le-appointed tutors\, and compete for a single EUR 20\,000 Biennale Colleg
 e Blend Award to the most compellingly structured project. ELIGIBILITY: in
 ternational\; apply as a team of one artist plus one production team membe
 r\, and BOTH must be aged 18 to 30 at the deadline (hard age cap). DEADLIN
 E: 19 October 2026\, 23:59 CEST.\n\nOrganisation: La Biennale di Venezia\n
 Location: Venice\, Italy (in-person workshop February 2027) plus an online
  workshop in April 2027. Open internationally\; BOTH team members must be 
 aged 18 to 30 at the deadline.\nAward: One Biennale College Blend Award of
  EUR 20\,000 to the most compellingly structured project. Accommodation co
 vered for the Venice workshop (travel not covered). No application fee.\nD
 uration: Two workshops (February and April 2027)\n\nMore: https://www.labi
 ennale.org/en/biennale-college-blend-programme-description-2026?utm_source
 =artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
