SUMMARY:Deadline: Arts Council of Ireland: Theatre Project Award 2027\, Rou
 nd 2
DESCRIPTION:The Theatre Project Award supports specific artistic projects i
 n theatre\, enabling individual artists and organisations to bring their i
 deas to fruition and create excellent work\, from script and concept devel
 opment through to new creations\, including devised\, interdisciplinary an
 d technology-led performance. WHO: individual theatre artists and theatre 
 organisations based in Ireland. WHAT YOU GET: a project grant of up to EUR
  26\,000 in this round (Play Development and Theatre Creation scales). APP
 LICATION: through the Arts Council online services portal\; read the 2027 
 guidelines on the award page first and contact theatre@artscouncil.ie with
  questions. Opened 20 October 2026. DEADLINE: 19 November 2026 at 17:30.\n
 \nOrganisation: Arts Council of Ireland / An Chomhairle Ealaion\nLocation:
  Republic of Ireland. For theatre artists and organisations based in Irela
 nd.\nAward: Up to EUR 26\,000 in Round 2. The award's strands are Play Dev
 elopment (up to EUR 15\,000)\, Theatre Creation (up to EUR 26\,000)\, Thea
 tre Presentation (up to EUR 80\,000) and Theatre Production (up to EUR 175
 \,000)\; the two larger strands ran in Round 1. No application fee.\nDurat
 ion: Specific theatre projects in 2027. Opened 20 October 2026.\n\nMore: h
 ttps://www.artscouncil.ie/funding-opportunities/theatre-project-award-roun
 d-2/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.artscouncil.ie/funding-opportunities/theatre-project-award-
 round-2/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Republic of Ireland. For theatre artists and organisations based i
 n Ireland.
END:VEVENT
